                        SKILL OF DODGE
|YK0++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++

|YKB'The easiest way to avoid being hit, is to not be the target.'|WK0 -
|RKBLord Sal Matis
|YK0
Dodge is a Monk specific stat. It relates primarily to a Monks
ability to avoid being hit in a physical confrontation. The
greater the dodging ability of a Monk, the less likely they are
to take blows. All Monks gain a rudimentary knowlege of this
skill, but it requires study to take full advantage of it. 
